<p>You fire an average of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2.8, 3.4, 3.8, 4.1, 4.3</acronym> shots at your target, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">47%, 55%, 60%, 65%, 70%</acronym> damage with each shot.</p>